  <ResearchProjectDef>
    <defName>ET_BasicBiosynthVat</defName>
    <label>Biosynthesis Chamber</label>
    <description>Learn how to create a terravat that specializes in utilizing and transforming flesh, organs, and other bodily parts. Notably, this vat is used for armor.
\nAdditionally, this immediately enables the creation of Terraplate armor.</description>
    <baseCost>2000</baseCost>
    <techLevel>Neolithic</techLevel>
    <tab>ET_ResearchTab_Organic</tab>
    <prerequisites>
      <li>ET_SmallTerravats</li>
      <li>ET_PeriwoodTerraseeds</li>
    </prerequisites>
    <requiredResearchBuilding>ET_BasicResearchBench</requiredResearchBuilding>
    <researchViewX>5.00</researchViewX>
    <researchViewY>1.40</researchViewY>
    <discoveredLetterTitle>About: Biosythesis Chambers</discoveredLetterTitle>
    <discoveredLetterText>Biosynthesis Chambers - often shortened to Biosynth Chambers - are special vats that serves as a direct, usable connection to the planet, allowing a faction to fully - and personally - embrace Terratech, often to a very permanent degree. Most armor sets will be created in these vats by using a large amount of their respective material(s), combined with one or more saps.
\nThe potential of this chamber is vast - it was known to create the rarest of saps, transfer sentience to giant plants, and was even capable of transforming beings into an ascended state. However, at the moment, only one set of (powerful) armor has been made attainable knowledge.
\nYou can check the description of the Biosynth Vat to see the current possible combinations.</discoveredLetterText>
  </ResearchProjectDef>

