  <ResearchProjectDef>
    <defName>ET_TierOneOrganicMastery</defName>
    <label>Organic Aptitude</label>
    <description>You've studied the behavior of Prima and Primwood plants to an exact science. This research shows you not only know how to handle these genomes, but also a deep understanding of their very composition.
\n\nOrganic Aptitude shows other Terratech colonies your dedication to the Terratech lifestyle. Terratech tribes will look more favorably on you, though another Mastery is required to show true devotion.</description>
    <baseCost>1600</baseCost>
    <techLevel>Neolithic</techLevel>
    <tab>ET_ResearchTab_Organic</tab>
    <hiddenPrerequisites>
      <li>ET_TerrasapBasics</li>
      <li>ET_TierTwoConduitSeeds</li>
      <li>ET_BasicBiosynthVat</li>
      <li>ET_PeriwoodTerraseeds</li>
    </hiddenPrerequisites>
    <requiredAnalyzed>
      <li>ET_KeyT2OrganicAptitude</li>
    </requiredAnalyzed>
    <requiredResearchBuilding>ET_BasicResearchBench</requiredResearchBuilding>
    <researchViewX>7.00</researchViewX>
    <researchViewY>0.70</researchViewY>
    <discoveredLetterTitle>Breakthrough Achieved!</discoveredLetterTitle>
    <discoveredLetterText>Your dedication to organic terratech culture is starting to pay off. the milestone you have reached has granted you a new understanding of organic nature as a whole, and how you can shape it all. This is just the beginning, however.
\nEntirely new terratech projects, alongside improving old research, awaits you.</discoveredLetterText>
  </ResearchProjectDef>

  <ResearchProjectDef>
    <defName>ET_MegafloraPlants</defName>
    <label>Megaflora Bioengineering</label>
    <description>Terraplants have incredibly complex biology, and this biology can only go so far in a small space.
This advancement allows you to shape seeds capable of growing into plants aren't restricted to a 1x1 size, and can instead go up to a 3x3 size. Bigger plants are theoretically possible, but require further research.
Additionally, it teaches you how to make a new conduit megatree.</description>
    <baseCost>2000</baseCost>
    <techLevel>Neolithic</techLevel>
    <tab>ET_ResearchTab_Organic</tab>
    <hiddenPrerequisites>
      <li>ET_TierOneOrganicMastery</li>
    </hiddenPrerequisites>
    <requiredAnalyzed>
      <li>ET_KeyT2Megaflora</li>
    </requiredAnalyzed>
    <requiredResearchBuilding>ET_BasicResearchBench</requiredResearchBuilding>
    <researchViewX>8.00</researchViewX>
    <researchViewY>0.00</researchViewY>
    <discoveredLetterTitle>Breakthrough achieved!</discoveredLetterTitle>
    <discoveredLetterText>Your study of creating larger, more powerful plants has paid off! You can now apply this knwoledge to further studies, allowing the creation of massive terraplants.
\nMost plants this research can be applied to requires further study, but certain previous plants can also have this applied as well.</discoveredLetterText>
  </ResearchProjectDef>

