  <ResearchProjectDef>
    <defName>ET_BriarGenome</defName>
    <label>Prima-Periwood Crossbreeding</label>
    <description>Discover how to combine the Prima and Periwood genomes to creature a specialized genome that utilizes the best traits of both.
This advancement is closely guarded by Terratech tribes. You will need to obtain and study a special tome to unlock these secrets. These special tomes can be bought from Terratech colonies.
\n\nThese seeds are shaped at the Terraforge, and take considerable time to finish. Stopping in the middle of creating a seed will require you to start all over again.</description>
    <baseCost>1500</baseCost>
    <techLevel>Neolithic</techLevel>
    <tab>ET_ResearchTab_Organic</tab>
    <hiddenPrerequisites>
      <li>ET_TierOneOrganicMastery</li>
    </hiddenPrerequisites>
    <requiredResearchBuilding>ET_BasicResearchBench</requiredResearchBuilding>
    <researchViewX>8.00</researchViewX>
    <researchViewY>1.40</researchViewY>
    <discoveredLetterTitle>New Genome Discovered!</discoveredLetterTitle>
    <discoveredLetterText>Your experiments of crossbreeding the Prima and Periwood genome has resulting in discovered a 'protected', secret genome: the Briar Genome.
The Briar Genome combines the growth speed and adaptability of the Prima genome with the flexability and resilience of the Periwood Genome. Additionally, creations of the Briar genome - true to it's name - posess thorny growths that are highly effective in offense and defense.
You can now create:
\nBriar Growths, which produce various briar weapons.
The Pantheon Terracannon, a giant, long-lived defensive turret.</discoveredLetterText>
  </ResearchProjectDef>

